What is MLflow?

MLflow is an open-source MLOps platform used to manage the complete machine learning lifecycle.

It helps with:

	Experiment tracking

	Model versioning

	Artifact storage

	Model deployment


------------------------------------------------------------------------------


Why MLflow?

	Machine learning projects generate:

	Multiple experiments

	Different models

	Many datasets

	Training metrics

	Artifacts

	MLflow helps organize and manage all these efficiently.


---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MLflow Lifecycle


	Train Model
	    ↓
	Track Experiment
	    ↓
	Store Artifacts
	    ↓
	Register Model
	    ↓
	Deploy Model
	    ↓
	Monitor


-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------


