1. MLflow Tracking

Most important feature.

Used to track:

	Parameters

	Metrics
	
	Artifacts
	
	Tags
	
	Runtime details


----------------------------------------------------------------------------------


Example 


import mlflow

with mlflow.start_run():

    mlflow.log_param(
        "learning_rate",
        0.01
    )

    mlflow.log_metric(
        "accuracy",
        0.95
    )


----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Common Metrics

	Metric
	accuracy
	precision
	recall
	f1-score
	loss

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Common Parameters

	Parameter
	learning_rate
	batch_size
	epochs
	max_depth

