2. Artifacts in MLflow

Artifacts are files generated during training.

Examples:

Artifact		Example
Models		model.pkl
Reports		report.txt
Images		confusion_matrix.png
Dataset		train.csv


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Example:

Log Artifact

mlflow.log_artifact(
    "report.txt"
)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------


Artifact Storage:

	Artifacts can be stored in:

Storage:

	Local filesystem

	MinIO

	Amazon S3

	GCS

	Azure Blob


